# Desktop shell and build tools, layered on top of the platform runtime lock
# (requirements-mac.lock.txt or requirements-windows.lock.txt). Resolve with the
# runtime lock as a constraint and hashes, for example on each target platform:
#
#   uv pip compile packaging/desktop/requirements-desktop.in \
#     --constraint requirements-mac.lock.txt --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes \
#     -o packaging/desktop/requirements-desktop-macos.lock.txt
#
# The build scripts refuse to run until the platform lock exists. Do not loosen
# existing runtime pins to satisfy these packages.
